#: src/ui/views/advanced.rs:259
msgid "Bluetooth needs a small audio reserve so the sound plays smoothly even when the wireless connection has tiny stutters. A bigger reserve hides hiccups but adds delay between picture and sound — keep the default unless your headset stutters or you need quicker audio."
msgstr ""

#: src/ui/views/advanced.rs:270
msgid "Lower delay (needs a stable headset, ~11 ms)"
